  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The book, with cover of hand-laid paper, is in a wooden box with a sliding glass top and a recessed space (7 x 5 x 1 cm) in the bottom for the seed packet. Glass top is etched with the word "plant" and seed packet printed with the word "dreams."</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"The artist's residency grant during which Plant Dreams was conceived and printed was supported in part with a grant from the National Endowment for the Arts, and the Andy Warhol Foundation for the Visual Arts"--Inserted note (6 x 5 cm).</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Issued in an edition of 32, numbered and signed by the artist.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
