    <subfield code="5">DLC</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Inspired by the artist's involvement with growing and harvesting flax, Plant Dreams is a meditation on the cycles of growth, decay, and regeneration"--Women's Studio Workshop website.</subfield>
  </datafield>
